Lock the realtime gateway to bandit and jose releases without known advisories.

Upstream realtime/mix.lock pins bandit 1.13.1 (12 EEF advisories, including
HTTP/1.1 chunked-body memory amplification, chunk-extension request smuggling
and WebSocket fragment/close handling) and jose 1.11.12 (8 EEF advisories).
`mix deps.update bandit jose` moves them to bandit 1.14.1 and jose 1.11.13
inside the existing mix.exs constraints, so only the lock changes. Drop this
patch once upstream's lock carries these versions or newer.

